The FFI modules transcribe structure layouts, constants and function signatures from
NVIDIA headers, so the program can call NVIDIA's driver libraries:

- src/gpu/nvenc/ffi.rs: nvEncodeAPI.h from the NVIDIA Video Codec SDK (API 12.1).
- src/gpu/capture/nvfbc/ffi.rs: NvFBC.h and NvFBCToDx9Vid.h from the NVIDIA Capture SDK 7.

Those headers are the work of NVIDIA Corporation and remain under NVIDIA's own terms. No
NVIDIA header or library is included in this repository or in the release downloads. NVIDIA,
NVENC and NvFBC are trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation.

The Rust code in this repository, including those modules, is under the BSD 2-Clause License.
